                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "cdcd7f4b-8b98-4fe3-a911-323a94fb54ea",
                        "source_entry_id": "725b314b-4828-38a8-9bcd-089f1cec8dab",
                        "source_sense_id": "7d755e9d-acde-37ec-ac3f-da87cfac0d6a",
                        "target_lang_word": "AI",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "AI",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4a965bb0-fc91-3976-a04d-28fcf1cef087",
                                        "entry_id": "f4ef8324-8405-3f54-afbb-a14cb597132d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Initialism of artificial intelligence."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "abbreviation",
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "countable",
                                            "initialism",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2537697d-75ae-4884-8fc6-cb2de71cdd0d",
                                                "sense_id": "4a965bb0-fc91-3976-a04d-28fcf1cef087",
                                                "text": "“Wintermute is the recognition code for an AI. I've got the Turing Registry Numbers. Artificial Intelligence.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d6a8e33c-1cfa-40c0-bde7-f07f2f01c2d0",
                                                "sense_id": "4a965bb0-fc91-3976-a04d-28fcf1cef087",
                                                "text": "The geth serve as a cautionary tale against the dangers of rogue AI, and in Citadel Space they are technically illegal. Advocacy groups argue, however, that an AI is a living, conscious entity deserving the same rights as organics. They argue that continued use of the term \"artificial\" is institutionalized racism on the part of organic life, the term \"synthetic\" is considered the politically correct alternative."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09b4ad3f-3102-42e0-83a8-264e306bca28",
                                                "sense_id": "4a965bb0-fc91-3976-a04d-28fcf1cef087",
                                                "text": "The result, Gurry said, will be many new AI-based methods and products that can change lives across the world."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dd623dd4-6aa8-408d-b0bf-a27cf3db883f",
                                                "sense_id": "4a965bb0-fc91-3976-a04d-28fcf1cef087",
                                                "text": "A Vatican directive supplements such principles and states AI should be “explainable” to humans, i.e., we should be able to explain the reasons for a decision made by AI. The document also states that AI should avoid discrimination."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b7f7799-ed37-461b-bd88-0497b39006be",
                                                "sense_id": "4a965bb0-fc91-3976-a04d-28fcf1cef087",
                                                "text": "The same is true for AIs that play (and win) these games."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d0860fd0-64b6-41d2-a114-0cd685e223b7",
                                                "sense_id": "4a965bb0-fc91-3976-a04d-28fcf1cef087",
                                                "text": "An aside: None of this danger depends on whether or not AIs are or can be conscious; it’s intrinsic to the notion of powerful cognitive systems that optimize hard and calculate outputs that meet sufficiently complicated outcome criteria."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "670cb0d2-322a-41ce-8647-0c4d29442e26",
                                                "sense_id": "4a965bb0-fc91-3976-a04d-28fcf1cef087",
                                                "text": "The report illustrated how easily matters of authorship can be muddled with AI using the example of a Gemini-generated cat smoking a pipe and reading a newspaper."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "65c22e1f-3b5c-331d-9fbf-7d7611c10fd4",
                                        "entry_id": "f4ef8324-8405-3f54-afbb-a14cb597132d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Initialism of artificial intelligence.",
                                            "A specific artificial intelligence program, such as the chatbot ChatGPT."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3223f9fa-f8a8-3a46-b595-49f386a0723e",
                                        "entry_id": "f4ef8324-8405-3f54-afbb-a14cb597132d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Initialism of artificial intelligence.",
                                            "The system that controls the behavior of enemies and non-player characters."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6456d059-010c-4c3b-9cb9-63402380065c",
                                                "sense_id": "3223f9fa-f8a8-3a46-b595-49f386a0723e",
                                                "text": "The character you are not controlling will follow you around and attack using [Sword of Mana]'s AI."
                                            }
